      "sourceBodySha256": "6344e60127b613c562c2c33ceda4d1b4ef11424e5141135cb38359417a27ccf8",
      "text": "7.3. The Annual Membership fee in (section 7.2) is charged in the first year and waived from the second year if the\nCardholder spends a total of AED 48,000 or more on retail purchases in the previous twelve months from the\nCard issuance anniversary date.\n7.4. FAB and ADNOC employees are exempted from paying Annual Membership fees. Should a Cardholder no\nlonger be employed by FAB or ADNOC, the standard Annual Membership fees will then apply with effect from\nthe following Card issuance anniversary date.",
