      "sourceBodySha256": "ae71ae0bec1df7497d035aa662fa3ad27b3154a40d4fa59e1bc2da488f769227",
      "text": "For new to bank customers onboarded on or after 21st December 2023, the card is free\nfor the first year. AMF will be the assessed only after their first anniversary onwards.\nFor example, if a customer is onboarded on 1st April 2024, there won’t be any AMF\ncharged after onboarding for the first year. The AMF will be chargeable only on\nanniversary, if spends of AED24,000 are not made during the year (i.e. between 1st April\n2024 to 30th March 2025) on non-educational spends.",
